        "original_id": "f5381207-26b8-5f31-83b7-870738b9425e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Townsend Coleman, Garth Jennings, Christophe Lourdelet, Matthew McConaughey, Reese Witherspoon, Seth MacFarlane, Scarlett Johansson, John C. Reilly, Taron Egerton, Tori Kelly\n- Works: My Life as a Teenage Robot, The Replacements, Knotty, Fantasia 2000, Sing, We're Dancin'\n- Roles: voice actor, host, director, writer, co-director, starring voice cast\n\nFacts:\n- In 1992, Townsend Coleman voiced Knotty in \"Knotty.\"\n- Townsend Coleman was the host of \"We're Dancin'.\"\n- In 1999, Townsend Coleman provided additional voices in the film \"Fantasia 2000.\"\n- Townsend Coleman also worked on \"My Life as a Teenage Robot\" and \"The Replacements.\"\n- In 2016, Townsend Coleman provided additional voices in the film \"Sing.\"\n- \"Sing\" was directed and written by Garth Jennings and co-directed by Christophe Lourdelet.\n- The starring voice cast of \"Sing\" included Matthew McConaughey, Reese Witherspoon, Seth MacFarlane, Scarlett Johansson, John C. Reilly, Taron Egerton, and Tori Kelly.",
